e prf-story\">As of Oct 12, October to November is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, with a normal of 5.20 inches, and it came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years since 1951. On the middle of the grids, September to October 2025 ran 22% of normal and October to November 2025 ran 34%. March to April 2026 came in at 29% of normal on the middle of the grids. All 8 grids had their driest year in 1954, as low as 60% of normal.</p>"}
